<section class="phero"><div class="phero-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roofer.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofer-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofer.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="896" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">/</i><span aria-current="page">Appraisal work</span></nav><p class="kicker">What we appraise</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services Across Maine</h1><p class="lede">From a single estimate review to full representation on an appraisal panel and neutral umpire work, every Maine Insurance Appraiser service starts with an independent scope of the loss.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-coral" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg><span>Call (844) 537-1427</span></a><a class="btn btn-line light" href="/reach-us/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="icards" data-stagger><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-work/party-appraiser-representation/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>01</small><h2>Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><span>Your own named appraiser when you invoke the appraisal clause on an underpaid Maine claim.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-work/homeowner-dispute-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>02</small><h2>Homeowner Claim Appraisal</h2><span>Independent appraisal for Maine homeowners whose accepted claim came in below repair cost.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-work/commercial-condo-association-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/condo-building-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>03</small><h2>Commercial, Condo &amp; HOA Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal for condo boards, HOAs, mill conversions and Maine commercial buildings.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-work/roof-hail-loss-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/shingles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/shingles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/shingles.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>04</small><h2>Roof &amp; Hail Claim Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal for underpaid roof and hail claims on shingle, cedar, slate and metal roofs.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-work/windstorm-microburst-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>05</small><h2>Windstorm &amp; Microburst Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal for wind, microburst and rare tornado damage when the payout misses the full scope.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-work/noreaster-hurricane-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-surf.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-surf-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-surf.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>06</small><h2>Nor’easter &amp; Hurricane Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal for nor’easter and post-tropical storm damage on the Maine coast and inland.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-work/water-damage-loss-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ceiling-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ceiling-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ceiling-damage.webp 800w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="800" height="1200" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>07</small><h2>Water Damage Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal for burst pipe, appliance leak and wind-driven rain claims that came in low.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-work/fire-smoke-puffback-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="957" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>08</small><h2>Fire, Smoke &amp; Puffback Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal for house fires, chimney and wood-stove fires, smoke and oil-burner puffback.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-work/ice-dam-snow-load-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/icicles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/icicles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/icicles.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="803" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>09</small><h2>Ice Dam &amp; Snow Load Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal for ice dam leaks and snow-load damage, Maine’s signature winter claim.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-work/fallen-tree-limb-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tree-on-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tree-on-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tree-on-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>10</small><h2>Fallen Tree Damage Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal when a tree or limb lands on your home, garage or camp and the payout falls short.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-work/carrier-estimate-line-review/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calc.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calc-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-calc.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="797" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>11</small><h2>Insurance Estimate Review</h2><span>A line-by-line review of your carrier’s estimate to size the gap before you decide on appraisal.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-work/umpire-neutral-panel-services/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/meeting.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/meeting-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/meeting.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>12</small><h2>Umpire &amp; Neutral Services</h2><span>Neutral umpire services for Maine appraisal panels when the two appraisers cannot agree.</span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-tint"><div class="wrap split top"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker dark">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most files begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review answers that in days, and some disputes close right there.</p><a class="btn btn-navy" href="/appraisal-work/carrier-estimate-line-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
<div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for one part of the process?</summary><p>Yes. Many owners start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></details><details><summary>Do you handle commercial and condo claims?</summary><p>Yes. Houses, camps, condominium associations, apartment buildings, retail, offices, churches and farm buildings.</p></details><details><summary>Do you work on claims outside southern Maine?</summary><p>Yes. We inspect in all 16 counties, including the islands and Aroostook County.</p></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="strip"><div class="wrap strip-in rv"><div><h2>Have an estimate that doesn’t add up?</h2><p>Email us the carrier’s estimate and your photos. We’ll review the lines and tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-coral" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg><span>(844) 537-1427</span></a><a class="btn btn-line light" href="/reach-us/">Send the estimate</a></div></div></section>
